# Buckets of Gold (bastok 41): Foss in Bastok Markets. The offer declined and accepted (option 0), the rusty bucket trade
# (five, not four), the completion repeated: the trade section matches every status but available.
lists BastokMarkets/Foss/onTrigger BastokMarkets/Foss/onTrade BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/271 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/272
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=-281,-12,-36
# a rusty bucket does not stack: one item line each (item RustyBucket x10 would be one slot of 10)
item RustyBucket
item RustyBucket
item RustyBucket
item RustyBucket
item RustyBucket
item RustyBucket
item RustyBucket
item RustyBucket
item RustyBucket
item RustyBucket
login
trade Foss RustyBucket x5       # available: no trade handler, nothing
trigger Foss                    # the offer, 271
finish option=1                 # declined: still available
trigger Foss                    # 271 again
finish option=0                 # accepted
trigger Foss                    # accepted: his default 270
finish
trade Foss RustyBucket x4       # four buckets: nothing
trade Foss RustyBucket x5       # 272
finish                          # completed: 300 gil, Bucket Fisher, fame 10, five buckets gone
trade Foss RustyBucket x5       # completed: 272 again
finish                          # the repeat: 300 gil, fame 10 again
